    },
    {
      "op": "text",
      "anchor": ".meaning-list",
      "html": "<div> <span class=\"number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01</span> <dt data-text=\"meaningOneTitle\">AI PARTICIPATED</dt> <dd data-text=\"meaningOneBody\">AI MATERIALLY HELPED CREATE, ANALYSE, TRANSFORM OR PRESENT THE WORK.</dd> </div> <div> <span class=\"number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">02</span> <dt data-text=\"meaningTwoTitle\">A HUMAN CHOSE</dt> <dd data-text=\"meaningTwoBody\">A PERSON OR ORGANISATION KNOWINGLY ADOPTED AND RELEASED THE RESULT.</dd> </div> <div> <span class=\"number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">03</span> <dt data-text=\"meaningThreeTitle\">RESPONSIBILITY STAYS HUMAN</dt> <dd data-text=\"meaningThreeBody\">THE NAMED PARTY DOES NOT TRANSFER ACCOUNTABILITY TO AN AI SYSTEM OR PROVIDER.</dd> </div>"
    },
    {
      "op": "insertAfter",
      "anchor": "#meaning",
      "html": "<div class=\"bunker-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"bunker\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 5\"><use href=\"#bunker\"/></svg><svg class=\"bunker\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 5\"><use href=\"#bunker\"/></svg><svg class=\"bunker\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 5\"><use href=\"#bunker\"/></svg><svg class=\"bunker\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 5\"><use href=\"#bunker\"/></svg></div>"
    },
    {
      "op": "text",
      "anchor": "#plainTitle",
      "html": "TRANSPARENT ASSISTANCE.<br>VISIBLE ACCOUNTABILITY."
    },
    {
      "op": "text",
      "anchor": ".plain-copy",
      "html": "<p data-text=\"plainLead\">THE MARK IS AN ACCOUNTABILITY DECLARATION, NOT A CLAIM THAT AI IS THE AUTHOR AND NOT A GUARANTEE THAT THE WORK IS CORRECT.</p> <p data-text=\"plainBody\">IT DOES NOT SAY HOW MUCH OF THE WORK CAME FROM AI. IT SAYS AI MATERIALLY INFLUENCED THE RESULT AND AN IDENTIFIABLE PERSON OR ORGANISATION STANDS BEHIND THE DECISION TO USE IT.</p> <blockquote data-text=\"plainQuote\">THREE CHARACTERS MAKE BOTH PARTICIPATION AND RESPONSIBILITY VISIBLE.</blockquote>"
    },
